      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Monotonic stack</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Next greater element</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/daily-temperatures/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 739</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Daily Temperatures</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">For every day, how long until a strictly warmer day? Keep the days that are still waiting on a stack; their temperatures decrease from bottom to top, so each new warmer day resolves a run of them from the top. Every day is pushed once and popped at most once: O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
